{"seq":2,"slug":"oscillators-feedback","title":"振荡器与反馈线路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/circuits/oscillators-feedback","wordCount":1490,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"振荡器与反馈线路\">振荡器与反馈线路</h1><p>与拨动开关同期诞生的另一座里程碑，是 Elowitz 和 Leibler 在 2000 年构建的「阻遏振荡器」（repressilator）：三个抑制基因首尾相接成环，让细胞自发地周期性闪烁荧光。如果说 <a href=\"switches-logic-gates\">基因开关与逻辑门</a> 教会细胞「记忆」与「计算」，振荡器则教会细胞「计时」——一种在没有外部节拍器的情况下自我组织出节律的能力。本篇讲清楚反馈如何产生振荡、振荡需要哪些条件、以及反馈这一更普遍的设计原语如何被用来稳定与调节线路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-负反馈与延迟\">核心概念：负反馈与延迟</h2><p>振荡的本质是<strong>带延迟的负反馈</strong>。单纯的负反馈（产物抑制自身合成）只会让系统稳定在一个固定点；但当负反馈中加入足够的时间延迟，系统就会「矫枉过正」——抑制信号总是滞后于浓度变化，于是浓度在目标值上下来回穿越，形成持续振荡。阻遏振荡器用三个基因串成的环提供了这种延迟：每个基因的产物抑制下一个，绕环一圈才回到自身。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;基因 A → 蛋白 a&quot;] --&gt;|抑制| B[&quot;基因 B → 蛋白 b&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|抑制| C[&quot;基因 C → 蛋白 c&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|抑制| A&#10;    R[&quot;报告基因 GFP&lt;br/&gt;跟随其中一个节点&quot;] -.-&gt;|读出节律| A\">graph TD\n    A[\"基因 A → 蛋白 a\"] --&gt;|抑制| B[\"基因 B → 蛋白 b\"]\n    B --&gt;|抑制| C[\"基因 C → 蛋白 c\"]\n    C --&gt;|抑制| A\n    R[\"报告基因 GFP&lt;br/&gt;跟随其中一个节点\"] -.-&gt;|读出节律| A</pre><p>为什么必须是三个（奇数）而非两个？两个互抑会锁成双稳态开关；三个奇数环则无法找到一个所有基因都满意的静止状态，系统被迫绕环周期运行。这正是同一个「互相抑制」的基元，因拓扑（环的奇偶）不同而产生记忆或节律两种截然不同行为的精彩例证——与 <a href=\"switches-logic-gates\">基因开关与逻辑门</a> 的双稳态形成鲜明对照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"振荡的存在条件\">振荡的存在条件</h2><p>振荡不是随便搭个负反馈环就能得到，它对参数有苛刻要求。对阻遏振荡器，三个对称节点的浓度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可用一组方程描述，每个基因的转录受上游抑制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dp_i}{dt} = \\frac{\\alpha}{1+p_{i-1}^n} + \\alpha_0 - p_i, \\qquad i=1,2,3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1288em;vertical-align:-1.0212em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6462em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3352em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0212em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是被抑制时仍残留的最大合成率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是泄漏表达，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是协同系数。线性稳定性分析给出一个直观结论：要让中心不动点失稳从而产生振荡，需要<strong>足够大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（强表达）、<strong>足够大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（陡峭抑制，通常需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）、以及<strong>足够小的泄漏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>振荡的要求</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最大合成速率</td>\n<td>越大越易振荡</td>\n<td>选强启动子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>协同系数</td>\n<td>通常需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>选协同抑制子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>泄漏表达</td>\n<td>越小越好</td>\n<td>选低本底启动子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛋白半衰期</td>\n<td>降解快慢</td>\n<td>适中，需匹配周期</td>\n<td>加降解标签调节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表本质上是把数学判据翻译成元件选型清单——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/dbtl-cycle\">设计-构建-测试-学习循环</a> 中「设计」阶段的工作方式：先用模型框定可行参数区，再到元件库里挑符合区间的部件。早期阻遏振荡器最大的毛病是周期不齐、细胞间不同步，后续工作通过降低泄漏、引入低降解蛋白显著提升了节律的规整度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈作为通用设计原语\">反馈作为通用设计原语</h2><p>振荡只是反馈的一种用途。反馈是合成生物学最强大的通用设计原语，它的两种基本形式服务于截然不同的目标：负反馈用于「稳定」，正反馈用于「放大与锁存」。</p>\n<p>负反馈最重要的工程价值，是赋予线路<strong>鲁棒性</strong>——抵抗扰动、降低噪声、加快响应。一个自抑制基因（产物抑制自身启动子）相比无反馈的组成型表达，能更快达到稳态，并对启动子拷贝数波动不那么敏感。这种「自我纠偏」能力，是把不可靠的生物部件拼成可靠系统的关键手段，也是应对 <a href=\"../foundations/engineering-paradigm\">合成生物学的工程范式</a> 所说「上下文依赖性」的有力武器。</p>\n<p>正反馈则相反：产物促进自身合成，制造出「赢者通吃」的开关式响应。前一篇的拨动开关本质上就是两条正反馈（双重负反馈等价于正反馈）的产物。正负反馈的组合能产生更丰富的行为，如可调频率的振荡、脉冲发生器、带通滤波器等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用导向的反馈线路\">应用导向的反馈线路</h2><p>把反馈线路与传感、执行模块耦合，就从「演示玩具」走向了有用的系统。一类重要应用是<strong>自适应控制</strong>：让线路像恒温器一样，无论外界如何变化都把某个内部量维持在设定点。其经典实现是「积分反馈」——线路对误差信号做时间积分并反馈，从而消除稳态偏差，这与控制工程里的 PID 思想同源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SET[&quot;设定点&quot;] --&gt; CMP[&quot;比较误差&quot;]&#10;    SENS[&quot;传感器&lt;br/&gt;测量内部量&quot;] --&gt; CMP&#10;    CMP --&gt; CTRL[&quot;积分控制器&lt;br/&gt;对误差积分&quot;]&#10;    CTRL --&gt; ACT[&quot;执行器&lt;br/&gt;调节合成速率&quot;]&#10;    ACT --&gt; PROC[&quot;被控过程&lt;br/&gt;代谢 / 表达&quot;]&#10;    PROC --&gt; SENS\">flowchart TD\n    SET[\"设定点\"] --&gt; CMP[\"比较误差\"]\n    SENS[\"传感器&lt;br/&gt;测量内部量\"] --&gt; CMP\n    CMP --&gt; CTRL[\"积分控制器&lt;br/&gt;对误差积分\"]\n    CTRL --&gt; ACT[\"执行器&lt;br/&gt;调节合成速率\"]\n    ACT --&gt; PROC[\"被控过程&lt;br/&gt;代谢 / 表达\"]\n    PROC --&gt; SENS</pre><p>这类自适应线路在 <a href=\"../applications/metabolic-engineering\">代谢工程与生物制造</a> 中尤其有价值：当中间代谢物积累过多时自动下调上游通量，既防止毒性又稳定产量。振荡线路则被探索用于同步种群行为、为下游事件提供时序。无论哪种用途，线路能否在真实细胞里稳定运行，最终都取决于元件间的串扰控制，这是 <a href=\"debugging-orthogonality\">线路调试与正交性</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>振荡的本质是<strong>带延迟的负反馈</strong>：延迟让抑制信号滞后，浓度反复穿越目标值形成节律。</li>\n<li>阻遏振荡器用<strong>奇数</strong>（三）基因环提供延迟；奇偶拓扑之差正是节律与记忆（双稳态）的分水岭。</li>\n<li>振荡需要强合成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、陡峭抑制（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）、低泄漏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——数学判据可直接翻译成元件选型清单。</li>\n<li>反馈是通用设计原语：<strong>负反馈</strong>带来鲁棒性与稳定，<strong>正反馈</strong>带来放大与锁存。</li>\n<li>与传感执行耦合的<strong>积分反馈</strong>线路实现自适应控制，在代谢工程中用于自动稳定通量与产量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"振荡器与反馈线路","id":"振荡器与反馈线路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：负反馈与延迟","id":"核心概念-负反馈与延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"振荡的存在条件","id":"振荡的存在条件"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈作为通用设计原语","id":"反馈作为通用设计原语"},{"level":2,"text":"应用导向的反馈线路","id":"应用导向的反馈线路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基因开关与逻辑门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/circuits/switches-logic-gates"},"next":{"title":"线路调试与正交性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/circuits/debugging-orthogonality"}}